{
  "name": "autogallery",
  "version": "2.19.20",
  "description": "Fast, local-first photo triage: plug in an SD card, cull with the keyboard, organize the best shots into dated album folders.",
  "main": "electron/main.js",
  "type": "module",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": {
    "name": "John Alexis Guerra Gómez",
    "email": "john.guerra@gmail.com",
    "url": "https://johnguerra.co"
  },
  "homepage": "https://johnguerra.co",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=24"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "node scripts/dev.mjs",
    "dev:server": "node --watch --watch-path=server server/index.js",
    "dev:ui": "vite ui",
    "electron:dev": "node scripts/dev.mjs --electron",
    "rebuild:electron": "electron-rebuild -f -w better-sqlite3 -w onnxruntime-node",
    "rebuild:node": "npm rebuild better-sqlite3",
    "electron:build": "npm run build && npm run rebuild:electron && electron-builder --mac --win --linux && npm run rebuild:node",
    "electron:build:mac": "npm run build && npm run rebuild:electron && electron-builder --mac && npm run rebuild:node",
    "build": "vite build ui",
    "test": "vitest run",
    "format": "prettier --write .",
    "format:check": "prettier --check .",
    "test:e2e": "playwright test",
    "test:e2e:ui": "playwright test --ui",
    "test:unit": "vitest run",
    "test:all": "npm run test:unit && npm run test:e2e"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@floating-ui/dom": "^1.8.0",
    "@huggingface/transformers": "^4.2.0",
    "@john-guerra/fisheye-nav": "^0.1.1",
    "@keckelt/tsne": "^1.0.2",
    "all-the-cities": "^3.1.0",
    "better-sqlite3": "^12.11.1",
    "cities.json": "^1.1.60",
    "d3": "^7.9.0",
    "electron-updater": "^6.8.9",
    "exifr": "^7.1.3",
    "express": "^5.2.1",
    "ffmpeg-static": "^5.3.0",
    "ffprobe-static": "^3.1.0",
    "i18n-iso-countries": "^7.14.0",
    "ml-pca": "^4.1.1",
    "multi-auto-select": "^0.0.13",
    "onnxruntime-node": "^1.27.0",
    "reactive-widget-helper": "^0.0.3",
    "sharp": "^0.35.3",
    "smart-labels": "^0.0.14",
    "sortablejs": "^1.15.7",
    "topojson-client": "^3.1.0",
    "umap-js": "^1.4.0",
    "world-atlas": "^2.0.2"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@electron/rebuild": "^4.2.0",
    "@john-guerra/d3-zoomable-axis": "^0.0.5",
    "@playwright/test": "^1.61.1",
    "@sveltejs/vite-plugin-svelte": "^7.2.0",
    "concurrently": "^10.0.3",
    "cross-env": "^10.1.0",
    "electron": "^43.1.1",
    "electron-builder": "^26.15.3",
    "prettier": "^3.9.5",
    "prettier-plugin-svelte": "^4.1.1",
    "svelte": "^5.56.5",
    "vite": "^8.1.4",
    "vitest": "^4.1.10",
    "wait-on": "^9.0.10"
  },
  "_overridesNotes": [
    "npm errors ('Override without name') if a comment key is placed INSIDE `overrides` itself — every key there is parsed as a real override target — so this note lives here instead, as a sibling field npm does not validate.",
    "@huggingface/transformers pins its OWN onnxruntime-node (1.24.3) and sharp (0.34.5), a second copy of each native addon that asarUnpack/electron-rebuild -w miss (#161/#67, and the exact shape of #67's launch crash).",
    "The \".\" key inside the nested onnxruntime-node override pins THAT package's own version to the root one ($onnxruntime-node) so npm hoists to a single copy; \"$sharp\" does the same for sharp.",
    "\"adm-zip\" MUST stay nested inside that SAME onnxruntime-node block, not as a sibling top-level \"onnxruntime-node\" override key. A sibling top-level key silently drops this adm-zip pin back to the vulnerable 0.5.18 (the 2.18.21 fix, GHSA-xcpc-8h2w-3j85) with no npm warning and no `npm ls` signal — only `npm audit --omit=dev` shows it. Verified empirically 2026-07-25 by bisecting three overrides shapes; re-run that audit after touching this block."
  ],
  "overrides": {
    "@huggingface/transformers": {
      "onnxruntime-node": {
        ".": "$onnxruntime-node",
        "adm-zip": "^0.6.0"
      },
      "sharp": "$sharp"
    }
  },
  "build": {
    "appId": "com.johnguerra.autogallery",
    "productName": "AutoGallery",
    "copyright": "© 2026 John Alexis Guerra Gómez · https://johnguerra.co",
    "npmRebuild": false,
    "afterPack": "build/adhoc-sign.cjs",
    "directories": {
      "output": "release"
    },
    "files": [
      "dist/**/*",
      "server/**/*",
      "!server/**/*.test.js",
      "electron/**/*",
      "package.json",
      "THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md",
      "!node_modules/world-atlas/**",
      "!node_modules/topojson-client/**",
      "!node_modules/cities.json/**",
      "!node_modules/smart-labels/**",
      "!node_modules/rollup/**",
      "!node_modules/@rollup/**",
      "!node_modules/rollup-plugin-ascii/**",
      "!node_modules/rollup-plugin-commonjs/**",
      "!node_modules/rollup-pluginutils/**",
      "!node_modules/terser/**"
    ],
    "asarUnpack": [
      "node_modules/sharp/**",
      "node_modules/@img/**",
      "node_modules/better-sqlite3/**",
      "node_modules/onnxruntime-node/**",
      "node_modules/ffmpeg-static/**",
      "node_modules/ffprobe-static/**"
    ],
    "mac": {
      "icon": "build/icon.icns",
      "target": [
        "dmg",
        "zip"
      ],
      "category": "public.app-category.photography"
    },
    "win": {
      "icon": "build/icon.png",
      "target": [
        "nsis"
      ]
    },
    "linux": {
      "icon": "build/icon.png",
      "maintainer": "John Alexis Guerra Gómez <john.guerra@gmail.com>",
      "target": [
        "AppImage"
      ],
      "category": "Graphics"
    },
    "publish": {
      "provider": "github",
      "owner": "john-guerra",
      "repo": "autoPhotoOrganizer"
    }
  }
}
